{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>視頻欣賞：</p>\n<p>界面列出了遊戲大小和評價，卻沒有顯示價格。視頻中可見《戰地6》《007：初露鋒芒》《極限競速：地平線5》《黑神話：悟空》等作品。目前沒有關於Overdrive技術原理的進一步信息。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"PS5越獄版出現Overdrive應用 遊戲及DLC似乎可免費下載\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261013/1791841197_953311_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>近期還有關於新PS5越獄方式的討論，以及在該主機上運行PS2光盤的相關説法。PS5越獄版上另有一款名為PSXBOX的Xbox雲遊戲客户端，據稱支持以1080p、60幀串流，兼容DualSense手柄，並提供統計數據、畫面選項和解像度等菜單功能。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"PS5越獄版出現Overdrive應用 遊戲及DLC似乎可免費下載\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261013/1791840013_500373_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>視頻欣賞：</p>\n\n<p>\n<img alt=\"PS5越獄版出現Overdrive應用 遊戲及DLC似乎可免費下載\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261013/1791841197_953311_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<img alt=\"PS5越獄版出現Overdrive應用 遊戲及DLC似乎可免費下載\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261013/1791840013_500373_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T05:40:20.550975+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":4,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T05:24:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T06:17:48.085702+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T05:37:40.050363+00:00","content_hash":"a9e2aeb9f5f7e61a04a3d3c695cb61bb32424183ffc1a2ae49593fa717353df1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}